{"id":"SgvvSXlwNqSow16m","meta":{"instanceId":"06e22c0aab9bd07ae70c04e937571d64a3542130ca7fd578fa778f59f8b464ef"},"name":"Real Estate Lead Management & Conversion","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"294880d5-e961-4e12-8cdc-7bcc51667d36","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[176,160],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":896,"content":"## Real Estate Lead Management & Conversion — Core Pipeline\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow captures real estate leads from web forms, WhatsApp, and Facebook Lead Ads, normalizes the payload, and checks HubSpot for duplicates before continuing. New leads are qualified by an AI agent, matched to an available sales agent from Google Sheets, optionally claim that agent’s slot, and are then created in HubSpot. After CRM creation, it sends separate email notifications to the assigned agent and to the lead with booking details.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the three webhook entry points for the web form, WhatsApp integration, and Facebook Lead Ads source.\n- Connect HubSpot credentials and ensure the duplicate search and lead creation fields match your CRM contact or deal schema.\n- Configure the DeepSeek chat model credentials used by the Lead Qualification Agent.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and prepare the agent availability sheet with the columns expected by the search and claim steps.\n- Connect Gmail credentials and verify sender settings, recipient fields, and email content generated by the message-building code nodes.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the normalization code for each lead source, the duplicate-matching criteria, the AI qualification prompt/scoring logic, agent assignment rules, and the booking/notification email templates."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"71f92ce1-5823-43eb-a89d-c88e7d16bfc1","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[736,384],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":704,"content":"## Capture and normalize leads\n\nCollects incoming leads from the three channel webhooks and converts them into a consistent lead payload for downstream processing."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"23d918f2-3f97-40a7-aba8-ae822167af9f","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1184,608],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":640,"height":304,"content":"## Check for duplicates\n\nSearches HubSpot for an existing lead, computes a duplicate flag, and routes the workflow based on whether the lead already exists."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"189153c4-6012-4c4a-a6d6-28dc00d3e5f9","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1920,672],"parameters":{"color":7,"height":368,"content":"## Stop duplicate leads\n\nLogs duplicate leads and ends the duplicate branch without creating a new CRM record or sending follow-up messages."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e4b9085e-fa22-462d-88a1-40ed7ebd9977","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1856,160],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":544,"height":480,"content":"## Qualify with AI\n\nUses the AI qualification agent and its DeepSeek chat model to assess the lead, then parses the model output into structured data."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"6360f747-848e-4473-bd24-d299d4ed719a","name":"Sticky Note5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2432,464],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":640,"height":304,"content":"## Find available agent\n\nLooks up available real estate agents in Google Sheets, prepares assignment details, and checks whether a suitable agent was found."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"81dde3d2-6dd5-4e72-9448-d7a578951093","name":"Sticky Note6","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3104,352],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":320,"content":"## Claim agent slot\n\nFor leads with an available agent, builds the claim payload and updates Google Sheets to reserve that agent’s slot."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"5f353cbf-c686-4691-9745-dfe75baafb36","name":"Sticky Note7","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3552,432],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":320,"content":"## Create CRM lead\n\nPrepares the final lead record, including assignment data when present, and creates the lead in HubSpot."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"2872335b-c810-461b-86cb-f4bddfc2465c","name":"Sticky Note8","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[4000,432],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":320,"content":"## Notify assigned agent\n\nBuilds an internal notification message and emails the assigned agent about the new qualified lead."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e9379892-b792-40aa-80ce-e26dc3c88111","name":"Sticky Note9","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[4000,784],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":384,"height":320,"content":"## Send booking email\n\nCreates the lead-facing booking message and emails the lead with the booking link or next-step instructions."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"51d1b667-e146-43db-8d1d-205ddd561660","name":"Capture Webform Leads","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[784,544],"webhookId":"9b49568b-0a7c-49e1-887d-05cfeabbe2e5","parameters":{"path":"re-lead-webform","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST"},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"c5169815-1879-4fe6-8b15-ff5f29bef12d","name":"Capture WhatsApp Leads","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[784,736],"webhookId":"a130ee4f-3523-4b52-ac42-b68971190cfa","parameters":{"path":"re-lead-whatsapp","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST"},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"9be5ae3e-1545-4084-8826-286826943177","name":"Capture Facebook Leads","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[784,928],"webhookId":"f90002d5-0cf6-4c82-8b75-538b0b88f24f","parameters":{"path":"re-lead-facebook","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST"},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"111dbea8-f0ea-4cde-b237-dfb06c6e45ab","name":"Normalize Incoming Leads","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1008,736],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const body = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\nlet source, name = '', phone = '', email = '', message = '', propertyType = '', budget = '', location = '';\n\nif (body.entry) {\n  source = 'facebook';\n  name = body.name || '';\n  phone = body.phone_number || body.phone || '';\n  email = body.email || '';\n  message = 'Facebook Lead Ad enquiry';\n} else if (body.messages || body.contacts || body.from) {\n  source = 'whatsapp';\n  phone = body.from || (body.contacts && body.contacts[0] && body.contacts[0].wa_id) || '';\n  name = (body.contacts && body.contacts[0] && body.contacts[0].profile && body.contacts[0].profile.name) || '';\n  message = (body.messages && body.messages[0] && body.messages[0].text && body.messages[0].text.body) || body.message || '';\n} else {\n  source = 'web_form';\n  name = body.name || '';\n  phone = body.phone || '';\n  email = body.email || '';\n  message = body.message || '';\n  propertyType = body.propertyType || '';\n  budget = body.budget || '';\n  location = body.location || '';\n}\n\nconst normalizedPhone = (phone || '').toString().replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(-10);\n\nreturn [{ json: { name, phone, normalizedPhone, email, message, source, propertyType, budget, location, submittedAt: new Date().toISOString() } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"61373218-71d0-40bb-ba36-bcc5de5d90a9","name":"Find Duplicate Leads in HubSpot","type":"n8n-nodes-base.hubspot","position":[1232,736],"parameters":{"limit":1,"operation":"search","authentication":"appToken","additionalFields":{"query":"={{$json.normalizedPhone}}"}},"credentials":{"hubspotAppToken":{"id":"CmZXrq54RepqOUl1","name":"HubSpot Service Key account"}},"typeVersion":2.2,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"a95d4d40-aee7-41d3-9c6d-a7bb4930a894","name":"Flag Duplicate Leads","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1456,736],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const searchResults = $input.all();\nconst isDuplicate = searchResults.length > 0 && !!searchResults[0].json.id;\nconst lead = $('Normalize Incoming Leads').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...lead, isDuplicate } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"1f2fd25a-9797-4489-a556-150a430b459b","name":"Check for Duplicates","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1680,736],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c1","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{$json.isDuplicate}}","rightValue":true}]}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"ce0bbfc5-9c40-4212-83b5-2c6f34520dbe","name":"Log and Skip Duplicates","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1968,880],"parameters":{"jsCode":"return [{ json: { note: 'Duplicate lead — skipped', phone: $json.phone, stoppedAt: new Date().toISOString() } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"e584a92e-c6c0-4644-953b-17466ebb5bb8","name":"Qualify Leads with AI","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","position":[1904,320],"parameters":{"text":"=You are a real estate lead qualification assistant. Analyze this enquiry and respond with ONLY valid JSON (no markdown, no code fences) in this exact shape: {\"leadType\": \"buying|selling|renting|valuation|general\", \"priority\": \"HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW\", \"budgetSignal\": \"string describing budget/intent if mentioned\", \"intentSummary\": \"one sentence summary\"}.\n\nLead details:\nName: {{$json.name}}\nPhone: {{$json.phone}}\nMessage: {{$json.message}}\nSource: {{$json.source}}\nProperty type mentioned: {{$json.propertyType}}\nBudget mentioned: {{$json.budget}}\nLocation mentioned: {{$json.location}}\n\nScoring guide: HIGH = ready to view/buy now, clear budget and timeline stated. MEDIUM = genuine interest but vague timeline or missing details. LOW = generic enquiry, no clear intent, or information-only request.","options":{},"promptType":"define"},"typeVersion":3.1},{"id":"5b8aec0a-defb-4398-bd60-448c692d76a8","name":"Extract AI Insights","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2256,432],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const raw = $json.output || $json.text || '';\nlet cleaned = raw.trim().replace(/^```json/i, '').replace(/^```/, '').replace(/```$/, '').trim();\nlet parsed;\ntry {\n  parsed = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n} catch (e) {\n  parsed = { leadType: 'general', priority: 'LOW', budgetSignal: 'unknown', intentSummary: 'Could not parse AI output' };\n}\nconst lead = $('Check for Duplicates').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...lead, leadType: parsed.leadType, priority: parsed.priority, budgetSignal: parsed.budgetSignal, intentSummary: parsed.intentSummary } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"68b11254-d5e9-4c12-a528-49abb57048c4","name":"Fetch Available Agents","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[2480,592],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":614649739,"cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1uqmbzBFlUT-REgEz-wcp2FdjSo-qBMNsR6Wqm58XjXM/edit#gid=614649739","cachedResultName":"Agents"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"1uqmbzBFlUT-REgEz-wcp2FdjSo-qBMNsR6Wqm58XjXM","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1uqmbzBFlUT-REgEz-wcp2FdjSo-qBMNsR6Wqm58XjXM/edit?usp=drivesdk","cachedResultName":"Real Estate Lead CRM"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"ByfFS0xgpBtYAp7o","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.7,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"1a6c8a58-f117-457c-833a-72b863fad8aa","name":"Organize Agent Information","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2704,592],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const agentResults = $input.all().filter(r => r.json.row_number !== undefined);\nagentResults.sort((a, b) => new Date(a.json.LastAssignedAt || 0) - new Date(b.json.LastAssignedAt || 0));\nconst hasAgent = agentResults.length > 0;\nconst lead = $('Extract AI Insights').first().json;\nconst agentRecord = hasAgent ? agentResults[0].json : null;\nreturn [{ json: { ...lead, assignedAgentRowNumber: hasAgent ? agentRecord.row_number : null, assignedAgentName: hasAgent ? (agentRecord.Name || 'Unassigned') : 'Unassigned', assignedAgentEmail: hasAgent ? (agentRecord.Email || '') : '', assignedAgentCalComLink: hasAgent ? (agentRecord.CalComLink || '') : '', hasAgent } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"503137d2-7b28-4387-861c-444f338298c1","name":"Determine Agent Availability","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[2928,592],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":3,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c2","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{$json.hasAgent}}","rightValue":true}]}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"4a096588-80f8-4a9e-8fba-0990119f6e24","name":"Create Agent Claim Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3152,512],"parameters":{"jsCode":"return [{ json: { row_number: $json.assignedAgentRowNumber, LastAssignedAt: new Date().toISOString() } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"69c9dff1-56f6-466d-b2b0-b7c25c712968","name":"Update Agent Slot in Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[3376,512],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[{"id":"Name","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"Name","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"Email","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"Email","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"Status","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"Status","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"LastAssignedAt","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"LastAssignedAt","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"row_number","type":"number","display":true,"removed":true,"readOnly":true,"required":false,"displayName":"row_number","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":["Name"],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"options":{},"operation":"update","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":614649739,"cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1uqmbzBFlUT-REgEz-wcp2FdjSo-qBMNsR6Wqm58XjXM/edit#gid=614649739","cachedResultName":"Agents"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"1uqmbzBFlUT-REgEz-wcp2FdjSo-qBMNsR6Wqm58XjXM","cachedResultUrl":"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1uqmbzBFlUT-REgEz-wcp2FdjSo-qBMNsR6Wqm58XjXM/edit?usp=drivesdk","cachedResultName":"Real Estate Lead CRM"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"ByfFS0xgpBtYAp7o","name":"Google Sheets account"}},"typeVersion":4.7},{"id":"d9e11311-eb15-4e63-889d-4eef511911ea","name":"Assemble Lead Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3600,592],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $('Organize Agent Information').first().json;\nconst nameParts = (d.name || '').trim().split(' ');\nconst firstname = nameParts[0] || '';\nconst lastname = nameParts.slice(1).join(' ') || '';\nconst email = (d.email && d.email.includes('@')) ? d.email : `${(d.phone || 'unknown').replace(/\\D/g, '')}@leads.placeholder.com`;\nreturn [{ json: { email, firstname, lastname, phone: d.phone, leadType: d.leadType, priority: d.priority, budgetSignal: d.budgetSignal, intentSummary: d.intentSummary, assignedAgentName: d.assignedAgentName, assignedAgentEmail: d.assignedAgentEmail, leadStatus: d.hasAgent ? 'Assigned' : 'Unassigned - No Agent Available' } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"2f758466-a182-4745-a3c7-7207e02fe9cc","name":"Add Lead to HubSpot CRM","type":"n8n-nodes-base.hubspot","position":[3824,592],"parameters":{"email":"={{$json.email}}","options":{},"authentication":"appToken","additionalFields":{"lastName":"={{$json.lastname}}","firstName":"={{$json.firstname}}","phoneNumber":"={{$json.phone}}","customPropertiesUi":{"customPropertiesValues":[{"value":"={{$json.leadType}}","property":"lead_type"},{"value":"={{$json.priority}}","property":"priority"},{"value":"={{$json.budgetSignal}}","property":"budget_signal"},{"value":"={{$json.intentSummary}}","property":"intent_summary"},{"value":"={{$json.assignedAgentName}}","property":"assigned_agent_name"},{"value":"={{$json.assignedAgentEmail}}","property":"assigned_agent_email"},{"value":"={{$json.leadStatus}}","property":"lead_status"}]}}},"credentials":{"hubspotAppToken":{"id":"CmZXrq54RepqOUl1","name":"HubSpot Service Key account"}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"8fc40f69-95ad-4106-9bef-6f5277ec2e73","name":"Compose Agent Notification","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[4048,592],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $('Organize Agent Information').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { to: d.assignedAgentEmail, subject: `New ${d.priority || 'LOW'} priority lead: ${d.name || ''}`, body: `New lead assigned to you.\\n\\nName: ${d.name || ''}\\nPhone: ${d.phone || ''}\\nType: ${d.leadType || ''}\\nPriority: ${d.priority || ''}\\nBudget signal: ${d.budgetSignal || ''}\\nSummary: ${d.intentSummary || ''}\\nSource: ${d.source || ''}\\n\\nRespond promptly - lead will auto-escalate if untouched.` } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"15a6821b-919b-4b7d-b30a-c190741aca5f","name":"Email Assigned Agent","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","onError":"continueRegularOutput","position":[4272,592],"webhookId":"4cfdf69d-48d6-4c8e-a205-f6f9aabe1a77","parameters":{"sendTo":"={{$json.to}}","message":"={{$json.body}}","options":{},"subject":"={{$json.subject}}"},"credentials":{"gmailOAuth2":{"id":"ZQN7cx5aUQj1b14w","name":"Gmail account"}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"34d7dd15-083b-4dd8-9285-f38b1b6d3366","name":"DeepSeek AI Chat Model","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatDeepSeek","position":[1920,496],"parameters":{"options":{}},"credentials":{"deepSeekApi":{"id":"ZuYjWkrq4helngPE","name":"DeepSeek account"}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e5869df4-b3d2-4337-8158-b8cf6b2ebc7b","name":"Draft Booking Email","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[4048,944],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $('Organize Agent Information').first().json;\nconst hasLink = d.hasAgent && d.assignedAgentCalComLink;\nreturn [{ json: { to: d.email, subject: 'Thanks for reaching out - next steps', body: hasLink ? `Hi ${d.name},\\n\\nThanks for your enquiry! ${d.assignedAgentName} will be your point of contact.\\n\\nYou can grab a time that works for you here: ${d.assignedAgentCalComLink}\\n\\nLooking forward to helping you find the right property.` : `Hi ${d.name},\\n\\nThanks for your enquiry! One of our agents will be in touch with you shortly to discuss your requirements.` } }]"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"f4719e17-752c-4541-9eac-909149e26ced","name":"Email Booking Link to Lead","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","onError":"continueRegularOutput","position":[4240,944],"webhookId":"6f6fd622-cebd-41b9-b78c-0cdefe74ca6b","parameters":{"sendTo":"={{$json.to}}","message":"={{$json.body}}","options":{},"subject":"={{$json.subject}}"},"credentials":{"gmailOAuth2":{"id":"ZQN7cx5aUQj1b14w","name":"Gmail account"}},"typeVersion":2.2}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"ed1ab485-c73f-45f4-a506-1dcebe6abada","nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"Assemble Lead Data":{"main":[[{"node":"Add Lead to HubSpot CRM","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Draft Booking Email":{"main":[[{"node":"Email Booking Link to Lead","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Extract AI Insights":{"main":[[{"node":"Fetch Available Agents","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Check for Duplicates":{"main":[[{"node":"Log and Skip Duplicates","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Qualify Leads with AI","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Flag Duplicate Leads":{"main":[[{"node":"Check for Duplicates","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Capture Webform Leads":{"main":[[{"node":"Normalize Incoming Leads","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Qualify Leads with AI":{"main":[[{"node":"Extract AI Insights","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Capture Facebook Leads":{"main":[[{"node":"Normalize Incoming Leads","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Capture WhatsApp Leads":{"main":[[{"node":"Normalize Incoming Leads","type":"main","index":0}]]},"DeepSeek AI Chat Model":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Qualify Leads with AI","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"Fetch Available Agents":{"main":[[{"node":"Organize Agent Information","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Add Lead to HubSpot CRM":{"main":[[{"node":"Compose Agent Notification","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Draft Booking Email","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Create Agent Claim Data":{"main":[[{"node":"Update Agent Slot in Sheets","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Normalize Incoming Leads":{"main":[[{"node":"Find Duplicate Leads in HubSpot","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Compose Agent Notification":{"main":[[{"node":"Email Assigned Agent","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Organize Agent Information":{"main":[[{"node":"Determine Agent Availability","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Update Agent Slot in Sheets":{"main":[[{"node":"Assemble Lead Data","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Determine Agent Availability":{"main":[[{"node":"Create Agent Claim Data","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Assemble Lead Data","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Find Duplicate Leads in HubSpot":{"main":[[{"node":"Flag Duplicate Leads","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}